Two layers (0017) with three views (0020, parked): a frame where three views filled the right periphery asks for the
layer's own periphery pass, so the periphery layer carries the filled image. Before, without another periphery pass
(stability, sharpening, Far depth, debug view) the periphery layer named the application's swapchain, whose right
view three views leaves unfilled (DCS draws only its strip there). Once made, the periphery output stays for the
session (dcsvrTwoLayerPrepare keeps any periphery output), so the swapchain the layer names changes once at most.

